Neeche pehla master prompt hai jo project ki foundation create karne ke liye hoga.

PROMPT 01 — MASTER PROJECT FOUNDATION
Build a professional, production-oriented, full-stack Electronic Showroom ERP and Business Management Web Application.

PROJECT OBJECTIVE:
Create a comprehensive ERP system for an electronics showroom, inspired by traditional electronics showroom accounting software, but with a significantly more modern, organized, responsive and user-friendly interface.

TECHNOLOGY:
